<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Generali buy of Fiat insurance unit.</title>
<headline>EU clears Generali buy of Fiat insurance unit.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Friday it had approved the acquisition by Generali of Fiat unit Prime in the field of life insurance and investment funds.</p>
<p>&quot;Even though Generali is the leading Italian group in the field of Italian life insurance, this purchase does not risk creating or strengthening a dominant position in the Common Market given the minor importance of Prime's activities in this field,&quot; the Commission said in a statement explaining its decision. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
